get.description:
Give one side or both: `from` + `from_network`, `to` + `to_network`. A side given halfway is a 400 for its missing half; neither side is a 400 `from_or_to_required` (there is no all-pairs list).

- both sides: that pair, when a source serves it (else an empty list);
- `from` only: every leg it can be swapped into;
- `to` only: every leg that can be swapped into it.

Pairs carry no limits — quotes do. CDN-cached for 60 s with a weak ETag.
